Benchmarking Scope

QSSI™ is intended to assess sovereign preparedness and capability across:

- Artificial Intelligence Capability
- Governance and Legal Quality
- National Resilience
- Post-Quantum Cybersecurity Readiness

---

Out-of-Scope Domains

The framework does not directly measure:

- Gross Domestic Product (GDP)
- Military Power
- Geopolitical Influence
- Political Ideology
- Electoral Outcomes
- Cultural Influence
- National Wealth

Results should therefore be interpreted exclusively within the framework's defined analytical scope.

